window.TOEIC=[{"code":"14-1","title":"就醫預約與互動：醫療服務溝通 (Medical Appointments & Interactions)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-1 保健場景-就醫預約與互動.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患致電醫療中心要求重新安排預約，並詢問牙科初診流程與診所延誤狀況。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解就醫與改期需求","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明就醫或改期需求，多益聽力 Part 3 常在此處考「來電目的（purpose）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, Riverside **Medical Center**. How may I **assist** you?","zh":"早上好，河濱醫療中心。請問有什麼我可以協助您的嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Hi, I'm calling to **reschedule** my **physical therapy** session with Doctor Martinez. It's currently booked for 2 PM tomorrow, but something came up. Could I move it to later in the week?","zh":"嗨，我打電話是要重新安排與 Martinez 醫生的物理治療課程。目前預約在明天下午 2 點，但臨時有些事情。我可以把它改到本週晚些時候嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical center","pos":"n.","zh":"醫療中心、醫院","syn":"hospital = healthcare center = healthcare campus","tip":"聽力中聽到 Medical Center 代表此處為大型綜合醫療設施，規模大於一般的 clinic（診所）。","trap":""},{"w":"Assist","pos":"v.","zh":"協助、幫助","syn":"help = support = aid","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Reschedule","pos":"v.","zh":"重新安排時間、改期","syn":"change time = rearrange = move to another slot","tip":"","trap":"reschedule（改期）絕對不等於 cancel（取消）！多益聽力最愛考此動作混淆。"},{"w":"Physical therapy","pos":"n.","zh":"物理治療","syn":"physiotherapy = rehabilitation","tip":"Martinez 醫生在此處為物理治療專科醫生（specialist）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對病人資訊與詢問初診表格","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認病患基本資料與病歷號碼。多益常考新病人與舊病人的流程差異（如填寫表格要求）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Let me check the schedule. May I have your **patient ID** number?","zh":"讓我幫您查詢一下時間表。方便請教您的病歷號碼嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"It's 45782. Oh, and I'm also coming in today for my first appointment at your **dental clinic**. Do I need to fill out any forms?","zh":"號碼是 45782。喔，還有我今天也要去你們的牙科診所進行我的第一次看診。我需要填寫任何表格嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Patient ID","pos":"n.","zh":"病歷號碼、病患識別碼","syn":"","tip":"在多益聽力中，行政人員核對身分時，提供 ID number、policy number（保單號碼）或 name 是標準任務流程。","trap":""},{"w":"Dental clinic","pos":"n.","zh":"牙科診所","syn":"dentist office = dental practice","tip":"","trap":"多重預約計算：男士在同一天安排了「物理治療」與「牙科看診」，在多益中同日多重預約（Same-day multiple）在系統中算作兩個分開的預約時段，不可混淆。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：物理治療改期與新病人填表要求","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"安排具體療程時程，並要求新病人提前完成必要的病史問卷（questionnaire）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, since you're a new dental patient, please complete the **medical history questionnaire** before you arrive. Now, for the physical therapy, I can **move** you to Thursday at 3 PM. Does that work?","zh":"是的，因為您是牙科的新病人，請在到達之前完成病史問卷。現在，關於物理治療，我可以將您移到週四下午 3 點。這樣可以嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Thursday's perfect. And what time should I come in today for the **dental appointment**?","zh":"週四太完美了。那我今天應該幾點來做牙科看診呢？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"New patient","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新病人、初診病患","syn":"first-time visitor = intake patient","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病史問卷","syn":"registration forms = intake forms = health record","tip":"講義指出新病人流程的黃金考點為：「病史問卷必須在就診前完成 (before you arrive / before your visit)」。","trap":""},{"w":"Move","pos":"v.","zh":"移動、更改時間","syn":"postpone to = shift = reschedule","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dental appointment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"牙科預約","syn":"","tip":"牙科服務包含 tooth cleaning (洗牙) 與 whitening procedure (美白療程)。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：時間確認與診所延誤告知","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"告知診所目前的稍微延誤狀況（running behind），提醒可能晚開始，病患表示運作正常並配合。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Your dental appointment is at 11 AM, but we're **running behind** about 15 minutes this morning, so it may start a little late.","zh":"您的牙科看診時間是上午 11 點，但我們今天早上進度落後了大約 15 分鐘，所以可能會稍微晚一點開始。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's fine. I'll **head over** soon. Thank you.","zh":"沒關係。我很快就會過去。謝謝妳。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Running behind","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"進度落後、延誤","syn":"experiencing a slight delay = running late = 15 minutes later","tip":"","trap":"15 minutes late 只是輕微延誤 (slight delay)，並不等於診所關門 (clinic closed)！"},{"w":"Head over","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"前往、出發","syn":"go to = travel to = depart for","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本留言為診所接待員 Sarah 致電病患 Mr. Thompson，告知其預約醫師臨時有手術需要改期，並說明新病人填表與改期時程安排。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：表明身分與告知看診預約","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"表明診所身分與來電目的。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"Hello, Mr. Thompson. This is Sarah calling from **Greenfield Dental Clinic**. I'm calling about your **tooth cleaning** and **whitening appointment** scheduled for tomorrow with Doctor Lee.","zh":"你好，湯普森先生。我是格林菲爾德牙科診所的莎拉打來的。我打電話是關於您明天與李醫生預約的洗牙和美白療程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Greenfield Dental Clinic","pos":"n.","zh":"格林菲爾德牙科診所","syn":"dentist office = dental practice","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Tooth cleaning","pos":"n.","zh":"洗牙","syn":"dental hygiene = teeth cleaning","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Whitening appointment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"美白預約","syn":"cosmetic dental booking","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：告知緊急手術需要改期","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出改期任務與突發原因（緊急手術）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"Unfortunately, Doctor Lee has been called in for an **emergency surgery**, so we'll need to **reschedule**.","zh":"不幸的是，李醫生臨時被召去進行一場緊急手術，所以我們需要重新安排時間。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Emergency surgery","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"緊急手術","syn":"","tip":"在多益聽力中，醫生無法看診最常見的原因是 Doctor has emergency surgery（醫生有緊急手術），此為標準考點。","trap":""},{"w":"Reschedule","pos":"v.","zh":"重新安排時間、改期","syn":"change the date = find another time","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：提供空檔時段與新病人填表要求","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供替代的預約時間（openings），並引導新病人（first visit）在看診前完成病史問卷。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"We have two **openings** next month — the 15th at 10 AM or the 22nd at 2 PM. Also, since this will be your **first visit** to our clinic, please remember to complete the new patient **medical history questionnaire** before your appointment.","zh":"我們下個月有兩個空檔——15號上午10點或22號下午2點。另外，由於這是您第一次光臨我們的診所，請記得在預約前完成新病人病史問卷。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Openings","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"空檔、可預約的時段","syn":"available slots = vacancies","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"First visit","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"第一次造訪、初診","syn":"first-time visitor = new patient","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病史問卷","syn":"health survey = intake form","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：線上填寫省時及回電確認","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導病患線上提前完成以節省現場時間，並要求撥打專線回覆。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"You can fill it out on our Web site **ahead of time**, which will save you some time on the day of your visit. Please call us back at 555-0123 to let us know which date **works best** for you. Thank you.","zh":"您可以提前在我們的網站上填寫，這樣在您就診當天可以節省一些時間。請撥打 555-0123 回電給我們，讓我們知道哪個日期最適合您。謝謝。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Ahead of time","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"提前、預先","syn":"in advance = beforehand","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Works best","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"最合適、最方便","syn":"is most convenient = suits you best","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本通知為 Westside Medical Center 發送給病患 Sarah Mitchell 的預約確認與就診重要 Reminders 郵件。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：確認多重就醫預約","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明來信目的為確認即將到來的預約，並提供病歷號核對。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Dear Ms. Mitchell, Thank you for choosing **Westside Medical Center** for your healthcare needs. —[1]—. This email is to **confirm** your **upcoming** appointments and provide some important reminders.","zh":"親愛的米切爾女士，感謝您選擇西區醫療中心來滿足您的醫療需求。—[1]—。這封電子郵件旨在確認您即將到來的預約並提供一些重要提醒。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Westside Medical Center","pos":"n.","zh":"西區醫療中心","syn":"healthcare campus = hospital complex","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Confirm","pos":"v.","zh":"確認、證實","syn":"verify = validate","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Upcoming","pos":"adj.","zh":"即將到來的","syn":"approaching = scheduled","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：列舉同日及跨科室多重預約","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"列出同一天（March 25th）包含物理治療（physical therapy）與回診（follow-up）之多重時程安排。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Your **check-up** with Doctor Kumar is scheduled for March 25 at 10 AM. Following that, you have a **physical therapy evaluation** at our **rehabilitation clinic** at 2 PM the **same day**. —[2]—.","zh":"您與 Kumar 醫生的檢查安排在 3 月 25 日上午 10 點。隨後，您將於同一天下午 2 點在我們的康復診所進行物理治療評估。—[2]—。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Check-up","pos":"n.","zh":"身體檢查、例行檢查","syn":"routine examination = general visit","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Physical therapy evaluation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"物理治療評估","syn":"physiotherapy assessment = rehab evaluation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Rehabilitation clinic","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"康復診所","syn":"rehab center = recovery facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Same day","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"同一天","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"同日多重預約：Mar 25 共有 10 AM 和 2 PM 兩次不同門診，這在系統中代表 two separate visits（兩次分開看診），會產生兩筆帳單與紀錄。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：專科回診與新病人線上填表","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明如果有後續治療需求，需撥打櫃台電話預約；同時提及 3 月 30 日的牙科預約為初診，必須在就診前填妥問卷。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"If your **therapist** determines that additional sessions are needed, you can call our **receptionist** at 555-0180 with your patient ID to schedule a **follow-up**. You are also scheduled for a **tooth cleaning** at our dental clinic on March 30. Since this will be your first visit to our **dental department**, please complete the **new patient medical history questionnaire** before your appointment. The form is **available** on our Web site at www.westsidemedical.com/newpatient. —[3]—.","zh":"如果您的治療師確定需要額外的療程，您可以致電 555-0180 聯繫我們的接待員，並提供您的病歷號來安排回診。您還安排在 3 月 30 日在我們的牙科診所進行洗牙。由於這是您第一次造訪我們的牙科部，請在預約前完成新病人病史問卷。該表格可在我們的網站上（www.westsidemedical.com/newpatient）下載。—[3]—。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Therapist","pos":"n.","zh":"治療師","syn":"specialist = rehab expert","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Receptionist","pos":"n.","zh":"接待員、前台人員","syn":"front desk staff = clerk","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Follow-up","pos":"n./adj.","zh":"後續回診、跟進","syn":"subsequent visit = additional session","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Tooth cleaning","pos":"n.","zh":"洗牙","syn":"dental hygiene = teeth cleaning","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dental department","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"牙科部門","syn":"dentistry unit = dental office","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"New patient medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新病人病史問卷","syn":"intake health questionnaire = registration forms","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Available","pos":"adj.","zh":"可獲得的、可用的","syn":"accessible = obtainable","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：提早到場辦理與48小時改期原則","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提醒病患提早到場（arrive 20 minutes before）完成現場文書，並訂立至少 48 小時改期的重要規定。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Please plan to **arrive 20 minutes before** each appointment to complete any remaining **paperwork** at the **front desk**. —[4]—. If you need to reschedule any of these appointments, we kindly ask that you provide at least **48 hours' notice**. We look forward to seeing you. Best regards, Westside Medical Center Appointments Team","zh":"請計劃在每次預約前 20 分鐘到達，以在前台完成任何剩餘的文書工作。—[4]—。如果您需要重新安排任何一項預約，我們懇請您至少提前 48 小時通知。我們期待與您見面。西區醫療中心預約團隊敬上"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Arrive 20 minutes before","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提前20分鐘到達","syn":"arrive early = two-thirds of an hour early","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Paperwork","pos":"n.","zh":"文書工作、表格手續","syn":"forms = documents","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Front desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"前台、掛號櫃台","syn":"registration desk = reception","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"48 hours' notice","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"48小時前通知","syn":"two days ahead = 48 hours early","tip":"取消或重新安排（cancel/reschedule）時，「提前48小時（two days ahead）」是醫療與牙科場景中的經典時程規定，務必牢記。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-2","title":"藥物與健康產品：藥房服務溝通 (Medication & Health Products)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-2 保健場景-藥物與健康產品.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現客戶 Jennifer Park 致電藥房，核對電子處方箋並詢問缺貨藥物特別訂購到貨時間與全天候專線諮詢服務。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解過敏藥物配藥需求","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明用藥需求，多益聽力 Part 3 常在此處考「來電目的（purpose）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Good afternoon, City **Pharmacy**. How can I help you?","zh":"下午好，城市藥房。請問有什麼我可以幫忙的嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Hi, I'm calling about a **prescription**. My doctor's office told me they sent it over electronically this morning. I need a **refill** on my **allergy medication**.","zh":"嗨，我打電話是關於一份處方箋。我醫生的辦公室告訴我，他們今天早上已經電子傳送過去了。我需要補充我的過敏藥物。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Pharmacy","pos":"n.","zh":"藥房、藥局","syn":"常與 medical office（診所）或 healthcare facility（醫療機構）等詞彙進行場景關聯。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription","pos":"n.","zh":"處方箋","syn":"在閱讀測驗中常代換為 Rx 或 doctor's order。","tip":"指必須由醫生開立的配藥指示（needs doctor's order），藥房無權自行開立處方藥。","trap":""},{"w":"Refill","pos":"n.","zh":"(處方的) 重新調配、補充藥物","syn":"常與 replenishment 或 renewal 進行代換。","tip":"","trap":"多益聽力最愛考「需求混淆」，請牢記 refill 只是補充藥物，不等於新處方（refill ≠ new prescription）！只要還有補充次數，就不用重新看醫生。"},{"w":"Allergy medication","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"過敏藥物","syn":"allergy pills = antihistamine","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對資料與告知特定劑量缺貨","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認藥物成分規格，通常會出現「庫存不足、劑量或品牌不符」等任務阻礙，為 Part 3 必抓的細節。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Sure, let me look that up. What's your name?","zh":"好的，讓我查一下。請問您的名字是？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Jennifer Park.","zh":"珍妮佛·朴。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"OK, I do see your prescription here, Ms. Park. However, the **dosage** your doctor prescribed isn't something we currently have **in stock**.","zh":"好的，朴女士，我確實看到您的處方箋了。然而，您醫生開立的特定劑量目前我們店裡沒有現貨庫存。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Dosage","pos":"n.","zh":"劑量、服用量","syn":"常與 dose 或 amount 進行代換。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"In stock","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"有庫存、有現貨","syn":"在多益閱讀中常與 available（可得到的）或 on hand（手頭有的）互換。","tip":"out of stock（缺貨，代換為 unavailable 或 need to order）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：安排特別訂購與非處方藥替代","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"安排取藥交付流程（如特別訂購與預估到貨日），或提供臨時的替代藥物，是聽力中高頻的「建議/行動題」落點。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"We'll need to order it, and it should **arrive by** Thursday.","zh":"我們需要另外訂購，而且它應該會在週四之前送達。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Thursday... that's two days from now. Is there anything I can take **in the meantime**? I've been having terrible symptoms.","zh":"週四...那是兩天後。這段等待期間有什麼我可以先服用的嗎？我一直有很嚴重的症狀。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"We do carry an **over-the-counter** antihistamine with similar effects.","zh":"我們確實有賣一種具類似效果的非處方抗組織胺藥。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Arrive by","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"在...前送達","syn":"常與 come by 或 get here by 互換。","tip":"","trap":"by Thursday 代表「不遲於週四 / 週四或之前」（no later than Thursday），絕對不等於週四當天（on Thursday）才到！此時間差是多益 Part 3 聽力的超級大重播地雷。"},{"w":"In the meantime","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在此期間、同時","syn":"常用於表示在等待預訂商品（order delivery）期間的過渡期，同義詞為 meanwhile。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Over-the-counter","pos":"adj.","zh":"非處方的、成藥的 (簡稱 OTC)","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"多益極常考「藥物誤判陷阱」。處方藥（prescription）必須有醫生處方；而非處方藥（OTC）則可由客戶直接購買（directly purchase / alternative options），兩者購買條件完全不同。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導諮詢全天候專業服務專線","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認後續處理狀態，提供全天候諮詢服務（helpline）或由認證專家（certified staff）解答副作用（side effects），作為對話的圓滿收尾。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"But if you'd like more detailed information about **side effects** or interactions with other medications, I'd recommend calling our 24-hour pharmacy **helpline**. You'll be connected directly with a certified **pharmacist** who can advise you.","zh":"但是如果您想了解有關副作用或與其他藥物相互作用的更多詳細資訊，我建議撥打我們的 24 小時藥房諮詢專線。您會直接聯絡到一位合格的藥劑師來為您提供建議。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"OK, I'll do that. Thanks for your help.","zh":"好的，我會去做的。謝謝您的幫忙。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Side effects","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"副作用","syn":"","tip":"指藥物伴隨的主要療效以外的身體反應。","trap":""},{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"諮詢服務專線","syn":"","tip":"指藥房提供客戶緊急諮詢（urgent questions）與解答用藥疑慮的電話管道。","trap":""},{"w":"Pharmacist","pos":"n.","zh":"藥劑師","syn":"在聽力中屬於 certified pharmacy staff（認證藥房人員）。","tip":"多益常設身分干擾，要聽清對話者是藥劑師（pharmacist）還是醫生（doctor），藥劑師可以調整用藥建議但不能開立全新處方。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本廣播為 MediCare 藥房店內重要服務與庫存更新公告，內容涵蓋月配處方領取、缺貨特定品牌週四到貨、維他命有效期提醒、止痛藥特價及 24 小時熱線服務。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告對象與告知月配處方已可領取","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"向來店顧客（shoppers）宣告月處方（monthly prescription）藥物補充（refills）已補貨，現在可以前來領取（collect）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Attention **shoppers**, this is your neighborhood MediCare Pharmacy with important updates. The pharmacy just received your **monthly prescription** from the hospital system, so customers waiting for refills can now **collect** them.","zh":"各位顧客請注意，這是您鄰近的 MediCare 藥房為您帶來的最新通知。藥房剛剛收到了您在醫院系統的每月配藥處方箋，因此等待藥物補充的顧客現在可以前來領取了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Shoppers","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"顧客、買手","syn":"","tip":"聽力中一開頭出現 Attention shoppers 或 attention clients 代表這是零售或店內廣播（in-store announcement）。","trap":""},{"w":"Monthly prescription","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月配藥處方箋","syn":"routine Rx refills = recurring medicines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Collect","pos":"v.","zh":"領取、收取","syn":"pick up = retrieve = get","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：報告多種過敏與季節藥物補貨狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認大批庫存已返店（back in stock），說明昨天貨運（shipment）帶來的最新狀況。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Our pharmacist reports that allergy pills and several medications are **back in stock** after yesterday's **shipment**.","zh":"我們的藥劑師報告，在昨天的貨運送達後，過敏藥和幾種常見藥物目前都已補齊庫存了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Back in stock","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"重新補足庫存","syn":"replenished = available on hand again","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Shipment","pos":"n.","zh":"運送之貨物、到貨","syn":"delivery = cargo supply","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：特殊劑量訂購、維他命檢查與止痛成藥特價","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"針對特殊劑量特定品牌安排週四到貨，提醒檢查維他命過期日，並宣傳折扣非處方藥（over-the-counter pain relief）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"However, we'll need to order that **specific brand**, which should **arrive by Thursday**, for certain prescriptions requiring special dosage forms. Please check **expiration dates** on all vitamins and **supplements** purchased before January. Our **medical supplies** section now offers over-the-counter pain relief at **discounted prices**.","zh":"然而，對於某些需要特殊劑型規格的處方，我們仍需要訂購那個特定品牌，預計會在週四前到貨。請檢查在一月份之前購買的所有維他命和營養補充品的有效期限。我們的醫療用品區現在正以優惠特價提供非處方的止痛藥物。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Specific brand","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"特定品牌","syn":"","tip":"多益聽力中，若要拿特定品牌或特殊規格劑量，往往需要額外調貨，這是常見的任務要求（need to order）。","trap":""},{"w":"Arrive by Thursday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週四前送達","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"選項中常出現 on Thursday 作為時間錯配誘餌，請認準 by（在...之前）。"},{"w":"Expiration dates","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"有效期限","syn":"expiry dates = best-before dates","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Supplements","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"營養補充品","syn":"vitamins = dietary additives","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical supplies","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"醫療用品","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Discounted prices","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"優惠折扣價","syn":"on sale = reduced rates = promotional offers","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導諮詢全天候熱線與營業時間","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供 24 小時熱線（helpline）解答副作用與服藥疑問，並提醒晚上 8 點前至處方櫃台（prescription counter）可享快速服務。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Remember, our 24-hour **helpline** connects you directly with **certified pharmacy staff** for questions about side effects or proper medication use. Visit our **prescription counter** **before 8 PM** today for faster service.","zh":"請記住，我們的 24 小時服務諮詢熱線可讓您直接與認證的藥房人員聯繫，以解答有關副作用或正確用藥的問題。今天請在晚上 8 點前造訪我們的處方配藥櫃台，以享受更快速的服務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"諮詢服務熱線","syn":"support hotline = consultation line","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Certified pharmacy staff","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證藥劑工作人員","syn":"licensed pharmacists = qualified medical staff","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription counter","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"配藥櫃台","syn":"dispensing counter = Rx pickup area","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Before 8 PM","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"晚上8點前","syn":"","tip":"此為廣播中的時間截至限制，8 PM 後可能服務放慢或部分櫃台關閉。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本顧客告示為 Hillside Pharmacy 於 4 月 1 日發布之處方藥物配藥、週一專家門診與 24 小時熱線服務改善說明。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告配藥服務改善目的","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布藥房配藥服務（prescription services）已與醫院系統對接，推行全新自動化訂購流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Dear **Valued** Customers, We're improving our **prescription services** to better serve your healthcare needs. —[1]—. The pharmacy just received your monthly prescription from the hospital system, implementing our new **automated ordering process**.","zh":"親愛的尊貴客戶，我們正在改善我們的處方箋配藥服務，以更好地滿足您的醫療需求。—[1]—。藥房剛剛收到您來自醫院系統的每月處方箋，這代表我們開始實行全新的自動化訂購流程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Valued","pos":"adj.","zh":"尊貴的、受重視的","syn":"loyal = esteemed","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"處方配藥服務","syn":"medicine dispensing = Rx fulfillment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Automated ordering process","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動化訂購流程","syn":"computerized order system = automated fulfillment","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：週一延長專家諮詢與大批補貨狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"自下週一（Monday）起提供劑量調整與副作用延長諮詢（extended consultations），並確認大批季節性藥物與過敏藥已到貨。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Starting Monday, our pharmacist will be available for **extended consultations** about medication, **dosage adjustments**, and potential side effects. —[2]—. All **allergy pills** and **seasonal medications** are now in stock following our latest shipment. For supplements and vitamins, please **verify** expiration dates at our medical supplies counter.","zh":"從週一開始，我們的藥劑師將可為您提供有關藥物、劑量調整和潛在副作用的延長諮詢服務。—[2]—。在我們最新一批貨物送達後，所有的過敏藥物和季節性藥物目前都有現貨。對於補充品和維他命，請到我們的醫療用品櫃台核對有效期限。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Extended consultations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"延長諮詢門診","syn":"longer advisory sessions = detailed specialist reviews","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dosage adjustments","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"劑量調整","syn":"modifying dose amounts = dose correction","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Allergy pills","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"過敏藥、抗組織胺","syn":"allergy medication = antihistamines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Seasonal medications","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"季節性藥物","syn":"","tip":"多益閱讀中常考「季節性商品或藥物（如花粉季、感冒季）」的大批補貨（in stock following latest shipment）。","trap":""},{"w":"Verify","pos":"v.","zh":"證實、核對","syn":"confirm = check = examine","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：特殊訂購週四到貨與提前 48 小時線上申請","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"特殊規格藥物可在週四前送達，並宣布一般補充藥物現在已可提前 48 小時線上提交。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"We'll need to **order** that specific brand, which should **arrive by Thursday**, for any specialized prescriptions not regularly stocked. —[3]—. This includes both prescription and over-the-counter medications. Refill requests can now be **submitted online** **48 hours in advance**.","zh":"對於任何非常備的特殊處方，我們仍需要訂購那個特定品牌，預計會在週四之前送達。—[3]—。這包括處方藥和非處方藥。重複配藥申請現在可以提前 48 小時在線上提交。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Order","pos":"v.","zh":"訂購、下訂","syn":"request = place an order","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Arrive by Thursday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週四前送達","syn":"","tip":"Thursday or before = no later than Thursday","trap":""},{"w":"Submitted online","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"線上提交","syn":"filed electronically = completed via the website","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"48 hours in advance","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"提前48小時","syn":"","tip":"two days ahead = 48 hours early","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：24 小時熱線諮詢與保險給付卡核對","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導利用 24 小時專線諮詢，並提出最核心的要求——「必須核對保險給付資格（insurance verification）」，領藥時務必攜帶保險卡。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Our 24-hour **helpline** connects you directly with **certified pharmacy staff** for **urgent questions**. —[4]—. This service ensures you always have access to **professional advice** about your medications, including proper dosage and **storage instructions**. Please note: **Insurance coverage verification** is required for all prescription medications. Bring your updated insurance card when **collecting refills**.","zh":"我們的 24 小時服務諮詢熱線可讓您直接與認證藥房人員聯繫以處理緊急問題。—[4]—。此服務可確保您隨時獲得有關藥物的專業建議，包括正確的劑量和儲存說明。請注意：所有處方藥都需要進行保險給付範圍驗證。領取補充藥物時，請攜帶您最新的保險卡。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"服務諮詢專線","syn":"support hotline = all-day advisory call","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Certified pharmacy staff","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證合格的藥房團隊","syn":"qualified professionals = licensed chemists","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Urgent questions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"緊急問題","syn":"pressing inquiries = emergencies","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Professional advice","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"專業建議","syn":"expert counsel = specialist guidance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Storage instructions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"儲存說明","syn":"preservation guidelines = maintenance rules","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Insurance coverage verification","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保險給付範圍驗證","syn":"benefit check = insurance verification","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Collecting refills","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"領取補充藥物","syn":"picking up replenishment = retrieving Rx renewal","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-3","title":"健康管理與營養：飲食諮詢溝通 (Health Management & Nutrition)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-3 保健場景-健康管理與營養.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現客戶在健康中心赴營養師預約，諮詢如何改善精力水平，並探討減少加工食品與客製化營養計畫。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：赴營養師預約以提升精力","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶說明來到健康中心（wellness center）之目的為看營養師，希望透過飲食改善精力（energy levels）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, I'm here for my appointment with the **nutritionist**. I've been exploring different **meal plans** to improve my **energy levels**.","zh":"早上好，我是來赴約與營養師的面談。我一直在探索不同的飲食計畫，以提高我的精力水平。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Nutritionist","pos":"n.","zh":"營養師、營養專家","syn":"dietitian = nutrition expert = certified wellness expert","tip":"","trap":"營養師絕對不等於醫生 (nutritionist ≠ doctor)！多益極愛考「來訪者與什麼身分的人說話（Most likely speaking to a nutritionist）」，切勿選 doctor 或 surgeon。"},{"w":"Meal plans","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"飲食計畫","syn":"eating plans = diet programs","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Energy levels","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"精力水平、活力程度","syn":"vitality = stamina = energy units","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：健康中心介紹與確認個人化目標","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"接待人員歡迎客戶，介紹營養專家專長為依據「飲食限制（dietary restrictions）」打造個人化計畫。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Welcome to our **wellness center**! Your nutritionist, Dr. Chen, will see you shortly. She specializes in creating **personalized nutrition plans** based on **dietary restrictions** and healthy lifestyle goals.","zh":"歡迎來到我們的健康中心！您的營養師陳醫生很快就會和您見面。她專注於根據飲食限制和健康生活方式目標來制定個人化營養計畫。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Wellness center","pos":"n.","zh":"健康中心、養生會館","syn":"fitness & nutrition facility = lifestyle clinic","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personalized nutrition plans","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"個人化營養計畫","syn":"customized eating programs = tailored diet plans","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dietary restrictions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"飲食限制","syn":"eating constraints = food limitations","tip":"飲食限制在多益中通常指過敏（allergy）、全素（vegan/vegetarian）或無麩質（gluten-free）等特殊用餐條件。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：專家建議減少加工食品與引進有機天然食材","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶說明專家核心建議為「減少加工食品」，並表達對天然食材與有機選擇（organic options）的興趣。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Great! The specialist **recommended reducing** **processed foods** in my daily meals. I'm also interested in learning about **organic options** with natural ingredients.","zh":"太棒了！專家建議在我的日常飲食中減少加工食品。我也很有興趣了解配有天然成分的有機選擇。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Recommended reducing","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"建議減少","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"reducing（減少）絕對不等於 eliminating / avoiding entirely（完全消除/完全避免）！多益極偏好此程度副詞/動詞的置換陷阱，請認準「減少 processed foods 攝取」即可。"},{"w":"Processed foods","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"加工食品","syn":"packaged foods = manufactured foods","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Organic options","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"有機選擇","syn":"chemical-free eating = natural food options","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：食物標籤閱讀與當天取得客製化計畫","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認諮詢項目包含食品標籤（food labels）與營養成分計算，並承諾「當天（today）」即可提供量身打造的健康計畫。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Dr. Chen can definitely help with that. She'll review **food labels** with you and calculate appropriate **calories**, **protein, fat, and sugar** intake for your diet.","zh":"陳醫生絕對能對此提供協助。她會與您一起審查食品標籤，並為您的飲食計算合適的卡路里、蛋白質、脂肪和糖分攝入量。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Perfect. Does the **wellness education session** include information about reading **nutrition facts**?","zh":"太完美了。健康教育課程中是否包含有關閱讀營養成分表的資訊？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, our wellness center offers **personalized consultations** with **certified nutrition experts** who cover all aspects of healthy eating. You'll receive a **customized plan today**.","zh":"是的，我們的健康中心提供與認證營養專家的個人化諮詢，內容涵蓋健康飲食的各個層面。您今天就會收到一份為您量身定制的客製化計畫。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Food labels / Nutrition facts","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"食品標籤、營養成分表","syn":"nutrition facts label = caloric content table","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Calories, protein, fat, sugar","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"卡路里、蛋白質、脂肪、糖分","syn":"energy units, muscle-building nutrients, lipids, sweeteners","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Wellness education session","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康教育課程","syn":"lifestyle coaching = diet seminar","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personalized consultations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"個人化諮詢","syn":"","tip":"*多益同義代換* : individual sessions = dietitian consultation","trap":""},{"w":"Certified nutrition experts","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證營養專家","syn":"qualified dietitians = registered experts","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Customized plan today","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"當天取得客製化計畫","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"today（今天/當天） ➔ 絕對不是 next week（下週）！多益聽力中常考「什麼時候可以拿到計畫（When will she receive the plan?）」，答案是 today（同一天）。"}]}]},{"code":"14-4","title":"醫療行政與設施：保險理賠與系統管理 (Medical Administration & Facilities)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-4 保健場景-醫療行政與設施.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患因醫療部分負擔金額有誤致電查詢，櫃台人員協助核對病歷並核准全額給付理賠，並提醒更新電子病歷檔案。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：發現帳單部分負擔金額有誤","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明帳單有錯誤（billing error），部分負擔金額（copayment amount）似乎有偏差。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good afternoon, I'm calling about my **billing statement**. There seems to be an error with my **copayment** amount.","zh":"下午好，我打電話是詢問我的費用帳單。我的部分負擔金額似乎有錯誤。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Billing statement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"帳單、費用對帳單","syn":"invoice = bill","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Copayment","pos":"n.","zh":"(保險) 部分負擔金額、掛號費","syn":"copay = partial payment","tip":"部分負擔指的是病患看診時「每次需要自己固定支付的小額費用（Fixed per-visit fee）」，並非總額。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對基本資料與查詢病歷狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"行政人員在數位系統中核對病患資料（patient data）與保單，確認保險已批准給付。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Let me check your **medical records** in our **digital system**. Can you provide your **patient data** and insurance information?","zh":"讓我在我們的數位系統中查看您的病歷。您能提供您的病患資料和保險資訊嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Sure. My **policy number** is 789456. Your insurance has **approved coverage** for the upcoming procedure, according to the letter I received.","zh":"當然可以。我的保單號碼是 789456。根據我收到的信件，您的保險已經核准了即將進行的醫療給付範圍。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical records","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"病歷、醫療紀錄","syn":"health records = medical background","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Digital system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"數位系統","syn":"digitized platform = electronic system","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Patient data","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病患資料","syn":"personal file = patient record","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Policy number","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保單號碼","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Approved coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"核准保險給付範圍","syn":"authorized benefits = approved insurance coverage","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：確認已達自付額標準並更新電子病歷平台","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認病患年度自付額已達標（deductible met），理賠（claim）將全額給付，引導客戶在線上更新同意書（consent form）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I see that here. The deductible was already met, so your **claim** should be fully covered. Please update your information in our **electronic health record platform** to ensure accurate billing.","zh":"我看到了。您的年度自付額已經達到了標準，所以您的理賠申請應該會獲得全額給付。請在我們的電子健康記錄平台更新您的資訊，以確保帳單計費準確。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"I submitted the **consent form** and updated my medical history last week. When will I receive the **corrected statement**?","zh":"我上週已經提交了同意書並更新了我的病史。我什麼時候會收到修改正確的對帳單呢？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Deductible","pos":"n.","zh":"(保險) 年度自付額門檻","syn":"out-of-pocket threshold","tip":"","trap":"copayment（每次看診付的部分負擔） ≠ deductible（年度需要累計達到的自付額門檻） ≠ total bill（全額帳單）！這三個概念是多益閱讀 Part 7 保險對照題中極核心的雷區。"},{"w":"Claim","pos":"n.","zh":"保險理賠申請","syn":"reimbursement request = insurance filing","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Electronic health record platform","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電子健康記錄平台","syn":"electronic platform = patient portal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Consent form","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"(醫療) 同意書","syn":"release form = authorization document","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corrected statement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"修改正確之費用對帳單","syn":"revised bill = adjusted invoice","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：承諾三個工作日內寄出與全新硬體設施效益","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認正確帳單將在「三個工作日（three business days）」內寄出，並宣傳新翻修設施（newly renovated facility）處理高效率。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Our **medical office** will send it **within three business days**. Our **newly renovated facility** incorporates the latest patient care technology, so all lab results and documents are processed faster now. The **hospital complex** billing department will also send a confirmation.","zh":"我們的醫療診所將會在三個工作日內寄出。我們新裝修的設施融入了最新的病患照護技術，因此現在所有的檢驗結果和文件處理都更為快速。醫院綜合大樓的帳務部門也會發送一份確認信。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical office","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"醫療診所","syn":"clinic = healthcare facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Within three business days","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在三個工作日內","syn":"","tip":"工作日（business days）不含週末（weekends）。如果週五下午打電話，三天內代表最晚下週三寄出。","trap":""},{"w":"Newly renovated facility","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新裝修/翻新設施","syn":"modernized facility = upgraded clinic = refurbished campus","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Hospital complex","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"醫院綜合大樓","syn":"medical center = healthcare campus","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本廣播為醫療診所向就診病患播報本週末進行數位系統升級更新，取消紙本表單，全面改用電子健康平台及掛號櫃台求助指引。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告本週末系統更新","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"通知病患診所將在「本週末（this weekend）」進行患者數據管理系統升級（upgrading），要求下次就診前在電子健康平台更新資訊。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Attention patients visiting our medical office. We're **upgrading** our patient data management system **this weekend**. Please update your information in our **electronic health record platform** **before your next visit**.","zh":"各位造訪我們診所的患者請注意。我們將在本週末升級我們的患者數據管理系統。請在您下一次就診前，先在我們的電子健康記錄平台上更新您的個人資訊。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Upgrading","pos":"v.","zh":"升級、更新","syn":"updating = modernizing","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"This weekend","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"本週末","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"this weekend（本週末） ➔ 絕對不是 next month（下個月）！多益最愛考系統是在何時進行轉型升級。"},{"w":"Electronic health record platform","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電子健康記錄平台","syn":"patient database portal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Before your next visit","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在您下次就診前","syn":"","tip":"此為時程上規定的動作，要求患者在來店前完成線上更新。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：數位化轉型之流程簡化效益","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明新數位系統（digital system）的目的為簡化病歷、對帳單與理賠處理流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"This **digital system** will **streamline** medical records, billing statements, and insurance claims processing.","zh":"此數位系統將會簡化您的病歷檔案、費用帳單以及保險理賠的處理程序。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Digital system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"數位化系統","syn":"digitized records = electronic software","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Streamline","pos":"v.","zh":"簡化、使效率化","syn":"simplify = optimize = make highly efficient","tip":"streamline 是一個在多益商務、物流及醫療行政管理中極高頻出現的黃金單字，指「透過取消繁雜步驟來提高效率（improve efficiency）」。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：即時通知、翻新硬體與取消紙本表單","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"新系統亮點為即時傳送通知，融入最新技術，且醫院大樓將徹底取消（eliminated）紙本病史表，全部改為線上驗證核對。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Your insurance has **approved coverage** for the upcoming procedure - such notifications will now arrive **instantly** through our **portal**. Our newly renovated facility **incorporates** the latest patient care technology, including **automated lab results delivery** and electronic consent forms. The hospital complex has **eliminated** paper medical history forms. All health insurance information, including copayments, deductibles, and coverage details, will be **accessible online**. Patients must **verify** their insurance data to ensure **accurate claim processing**.","zh":"您的保險已核准即將進行的醫療給付——此類通知現在將會即時發送到我們的入口網站中。我們全新裝修的設施融合了最新的病患照護技術，包括自動化檢驗結果傳送和電子同意書。本醫院綜合大樓已取消了紙本病史表格。所有的健康保險資訊，包括部分負擔、自付額以及給付範圍細節，都可在線上查詢。病患必須核對其保險資料，以確保理賠處理的準確性。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Approved coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"核准保險給付","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Instantly","pos":"adv.","zh":"即時地、立刻地","syn":"immediately = without delay","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Portal","pos":"n.","zh":"入口網站、門戶網站","syn":"online system = patient database","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Incorporates","pos":"v.","zh":"融入、整合","syn":"integrates = includes = combines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Automated lab results delivery","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動化檢驗結果傳送","syn":"computerized test result transit","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Eliminated","pos":"adj./v.","zh":"取消的、根除的","syn":"cancelled = removed = discontinued","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Accessible online","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"線上可查詢的/可存取的","syn":"digitally available = attainable on website","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Verify","pos":"v.","zh":"驗證、核對","syn":"check = confirm","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導至掛號櫃台求助與病患隱私承諾","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導需要協助的患者前往掛號櫃台（registration desk），並重申病患隱私與資料安全為第一首要任務（top priority）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Visit the **registration desk** for assistance with the new system. Remember, protecting your patient data remains our **top priority**.","zh":"若需要新系統的協助，請前往掛號櫃台。請記住，保護您的病患資料始終是我們的首要任務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Registration desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"掛號櫃台、報到櫃台","syn":"front desk = reception counter","tip":"","trap":"地點與職責對應：尋求新系統協助或提交同意書是在掛號櫃台 (registration desk) ➔ 絕對不是處理費用的 帳務部門 (billing department)！"},{"w":"Top priority","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"最首要任務、最高優先","syn":"most important concern = primary focus = chief objective","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-5","title":"健身與健康活動：會員服務與健康計畫 (Fitness & Health Activities)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-5 保健場景-健身與健康活動.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患前往健身中心，諮詢企業會員方案與每週150分鐘運動要求以符合保險給付，並詢問二樓瑜伽課程。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解健康計畫與會員選擇","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"病患至 Premier Fitness Center 詢問健康計畫（wellness program）與會員資格（membership）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Welcome to Premier **Fitness Center**! Are you interested in our **membership options**?","zh":"歡迎來到卓越健身中心！您對我們的會員選項有興趣嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, I'd like to know about your **wellness program** and fitness classes.","zh":"是的，我想了解你們的健康計畫和健身課程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Fitness center","pos":"n.","zh":"健身中心","syn":"gym = workout facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Membership options","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"會員選項、會員資格","syn":"enrollment packages = subscription options","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Wellness program","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康計畫、養生專案","syn":"health initiative = fitness program","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：每週150分鐘運動保險要求細節","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認此健康計畫之核心參與規定為「每週150分鐘活動量」，並提供重訓、瑜伽與復健（rehabilitation）等多樣服務。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"The program requires participants to complete 150 minutes of activity weekly, right?","zh":"該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，對嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's correct. Join today and enjoy **unlimited use** of all our equipment and classes. We offer **yoga, aerobics, and strength training**. Personal training and **rehabilitation services** are also available.","zh":"沒錯。今天加入即可無限使用我們所有的器材和課程。我們提供瑜伽、有氧運動和重量訓練。同時也提供私人訓練和康復理療服務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"150 minutes weekly","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每週150分鐘","syn":"two and a half hours a week = 2.5 hours weekly","tip":"","trap":"多益閱讀 Part 7 喜歡考轉換計算，150 minutes = two and a half hours，千萬不要被 120 minutes (2 hours) 或 180 minutes (3 hours) 誤導！"},{"w":"Unlimited use","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"無限使用","syn":"unrestricted entry = full access","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Yoga, aerobics, strength training","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"瑜伽、有氧、重訓","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Rehabilitation services","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"復健理療服務","syn":"recovery services = rehab physical therapy","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：詢問二樓瑜伽課與下週健康博覽會推廣","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認早晨課程安排於二樓（second floor）主教室，並宣傳下週有健康博覽會（health fair）提供免費健康評估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Great! When does the **morning yoga class** start?","zh":"太棒了！早上的瑜伽課幾點開始？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"My morning session starts at **7:30** in the **main studio** on the **second floor**. We're also hosting a **health fair** next week where you can get a **free wellness assessment** and try different workout routines.","zh":"我的晨間課程在 7 點 30 分開始，地點在二樓的主教室。我們下週還將舉辦一場健康博覽會，您可以在那裡獲得免費的健康評估，並嘗試不同的運動項目。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Morning yoga class / session","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"晨間瑜伽課","syn":"AM class = early workout","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"7:30","pos":"n.","zh":"早上7點30分","syn":"","tip":"注意 AM/PM 的時間區隔，7:30 AM 為早晨看診/上課高峰。","trap":""},{"w":"Main studio","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"主教室","syn":"exercise room = classroom","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Second floor","pos":"n.","zh":"二樓","syn":"level 2 = upstairs","tip":"","trap":"活動在二樓 (second floor / level 2 / upstairs) ➔ 絕對不是 一樓 (first floor / level 1 / downstairs)！"},{"w":"Health fair","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康博覽會","syn":"health exhibition = wellness event","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Free wellness assessment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"免費健康評估","syn":"complimentary health check = free evaluation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：器材全免與現場填表申請加入","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認不需要自備運動器材（gym provides everything），病患決定當天填表加入。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Perfect. Do I need to bring my own **exercise equipment**?","zh":"太完美了。我需要自備運動器材嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"No, the **gym provides everything**. Just complete your **membership application** and you can start today.","zh":"不需要，健身房提供所有器材。只需填寫您的會員申請表，您今天就可以開始了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Exercise equipment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"運動器材、健身設備","syn":"workout gear = exercise machines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Gym provides everything","pos":"clause","zh":"健身房提供所有東西","syn":"all facilities included = complimentary amenities","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Membership application","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"會員申請表","syn":"","tip":"*多益同義代換* : enrollment form = registration sheet","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本公告為健身中心經理向會員播報月底加入之無限使用特別優惠，說明新健康計畫下週一啟動，以及每週150分鐘的復健給付門檻。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布月底前加入無限使用特別優惠","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布本月底截止的特別優惠：今天加入即可無限使用（unlimited use）所有器材與課程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"Good morning, members! This is your **fitness center manager** with exciting updates. Join today and enjoy **unlimited use** of all our equipment and classes - this special offer extends through **month-end**.","zh":"會員們早上好！這是您的健身中心經理為您帶來的興奮好消息。今天加入即可享受我們所有設備和課程的無限使用——此項特別優惠將一直持續到月底。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Fitness center manager","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健身中心經理","syn":"gym supervisor = club director","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Unlimited use","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"無限使用權","syn":"full access = unrestricted entry","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Month-end","pos":"n.","zh":"月底","syn":"end of the month = closing of current cycle","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：週一推出新健康計畫與每週150分鐘運動要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布新健康計畫將在「週一啟動（launches Monday）」，並強調復健給付之每週 150 分鐘運動時數門檻。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"Our new wellness program **launches Monday**, featuring expanded fitness classes including yoga, aerobics, and strength training. The program requires participants to complete 150 minutes of activity weekly to qualify for **rehabilitation services coverage**.","zh":"我們全新的健康計畫將於下週一啟動，提供包括瑜伽、有氧運動和重量訓練在內的多樣化健身課程。該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，以符合康復理療服務的保險給付資格。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Launches Monday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週一推出/啟動","syn":"commences next Monday = starts early next week","tip":"","trap":"Monday launch（週一啟動健康計畫） ➔ 絕對不是 Saturday fair（下週六博覽會）！兩大活動時間點各異，注意混淆。"},{"w":"Rehabilitation services coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"復健服務保險給付","syn":"rehab therapy insurance benefit","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：二樓主教室晨間課與下週六博覽會","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"晨間課程 7:30 在二樓主教室上課，下週六（Next Saturday）將舉辦健康博覽會，現有會員享有優先預約權。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"My morning session starts at **7:30 in the main studio on the second floor**, and I'll be leading **personal training demonstrations**. Next Saturday's health fair will **showcase** our exercise equipment and offer free wellness assessments. **Current membership holders** receive **priority booking** for all workout sessions.","zh":"我的晨間課程於 7 點 30 分在二樓主教室開始，我將親自帶領私人教練示範。下週六的健康博覽會將展示我們的運動器材並提供免費的健康評估。現有的會員可以享有所有健身時段的優先預約權。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"7:30 in the main studio on the second floor","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"7點30分在二樓主教室","syn":"","tip":"二樓在英文中除了 second floor，也常被代換為 upstairs 或是 level 2。","trap":""},{"w":"Showcase","pos":"v.","zh":"展示、展示陳列","syn":"display = exhibit = demonstrate","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Current membership holders","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"現有會員","syn":"active members = enrolled clients","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Priority booking","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"優先預約權","syn":"preferential scheduling = advance reservation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：延長營業時間與前台登記","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣佈延長營業時間（extend hours）以應對增加之需求，並引導病患至前台（front desk）登記排程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"The gym will **extend hours** to **accommodate increased demand**. **Register** at the **front desk** for your preferred fitness class schedule.","zh":"健身房將延長營業時間以應對日益增長的需求。請到前台登記您偏好的健身課程時間表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Extend hours","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"延長營業時間","syn":"longer operating hours = open later","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Accommodate increased demand","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"容納/應對增長之需求","syn":"meet growing customer needs = handle larger attendance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Register","pos":"v.","zh":"登記、註冊","syn":"sign up = enroll","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Front desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"前台、服務台","syn":"registration desk = reception counter","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本備忘錄為 Human Resources（人資部門）發布給全體員工之 Elite Fitness Center 企業健康計畫合作 launch 及相關福利。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布與健身中心建立夥伴關係","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布與 Elite 建立夥伴關係（partnership），提供全套企業健康計畫（corporate membership），加入即可享有無限使用福利。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"Dear Team, We're excited to announce our **partnership** with Elite Fitness Center to provide **comprehensive wellness benefits**. —[1]—. Join today and enjoy unlimited use of all our equipment and classes through this **corporate membership**.","zh":"親愛的團隊成員，我們非常高興地宣布我們與 Elite 健身中心建立了合作夥伴關係，為大家提供全面的健康福利。—[1]—。今天加入，即可透過此企業會員方案無限使用其所有的器材和課程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Partnership","pos":"n.","zh":"合作夥伴關係","syn":"collaboration = alliance = strategic agreement","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Comprehensive wellness benefits","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"全面健康福利","syn":"all-inclusive fitness perks = overall health incentives","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corporate membership","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"企業會員資格","syn":"company-sponsored subscription = employer-paid plan","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：計畫涵蓋範圍與每週150分鐘保險折扣要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"計畫包含瑜伽、有氧、重訓及復健理療。強調每週運動必須滿 150 分鐘以維持健康保險折扣資格。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"The wellness program includes **access** to their gym, fitness classes, and **personal training services**. —[2]—. Available options include yoga, aerobics, strength training, and **specialized rehabilitation services**. The program requires participants to complete **150 minutes of activity weekly** to **maintain eligibility** for **health insurance discounts**.","zh":"此健康計畫包括使用他們的健身房、健身課程以及私人教練服務。—[2]—。可選的項目包括瑜伽、有氧運動、重量訓練和專業的康復理療服務。該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，以維持其健康保險折扣的資格。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Access","pos":"n./v.","zh":"使用權、進入","syn":"entry = permission to use","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personal training services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"私人訓練教練服務","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Specialized rehabilitation services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"專業康復理療服務","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"150 minutes of activity weekly","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每週150分鐘運動要求","syn":"two and a half hours each week","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Maintain eligibility","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"維持符合資格","syn":"keep the qualification = remain eligible","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Health insurance discounts","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保費折扣優惠","syn":"premium reductions = insurance rate benefits","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：二樓晨間課與每月評估出席追蹤","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"每週二週四（Tuesday and Thursday）早上 7:30 晨間課程於二樓主教室上課，將進行出席率追蹤（track attendance）與每月健康評估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"My morning session starts at 7:30 in the main studio on the second floor - I'll be there as your **wellness coordinator** **every Tuesday and Thursday**. —[3]—. The fitness center will **track your workout attendance** and provide **monthly wellness assessments** to monitor progress.","zh":"我的晨間課程在 7 點 30 分於二樓主教室開始——每週二和週四我都會在那裡擔任大家的健康協調員。—[3]—。健身中心將會追蹤您的健身出席率，並提供每月的健康評估來監控進度。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Wellness coordinator","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康協調員","syn":"health supervisor = program administrator","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Every Tuesday and Thursday","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"每週二與週四","syn":"","tip":"此為固定的二日制（bi-weekly）排班，也是常考的時間考點。","trap":""},{"w":"Track your workout attendance","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"追蹤健身出席率","syn":"monitor class participation = record attendance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Monthly wellness assessments","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月健康評估","syn":"recurring fitness evaluation = monthly progress checks","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：6月20日博覽會與7月1日福利生效企業代碼","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布 6 月 20 日將舉辦健康博覽會（health fair），福利於 7 月 1 日全面生效（full benefits starting July 1st），員工可向人資（HR）取得專屬企業代碼（corporate code）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"**A health fair on June 20th** will introduce all exercise equipment and available services. —[4]—. Membership registration begins immediately, with **full benefits starting July 1st**. Contact HR for your **corporate membership code** and fitness class schedule.","zh":"6 月 20 日的健康博覽會將會介紹所有的運動器材和可用的服務。—[4]—。會員資格註冊即刻開始，完整福利將於 7 月 1 日全面啟動。請聯繫人資部門取得您的企業會員專屬代碼和健身課程時間表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"A health fair on June 20th","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"6月20日健康博覽會","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Full benefits starting July 1st","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"7月1日福利生效","syn":"effective date July 1st = launching July 1","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corporate membership code","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"企業會員專屬代碼","syn":"company-specific discount code = access code","tip":"","trap":""}]}]}];